# Browser builds for playwright-core 1.56.1 on Windows, unpacked into the
# realized prefix beside the library (packages/playwright.nim, "Layout").
#
# <destination> <sha256> <url> <archiveType> <stripComponents>
#
# Derived from playwright-core-1.56.1.tgz, by hand:
#
# * Revisions: browsers.json -- chromium 1194, chromium-headless-shell 1194,
#   ffmpeg 1011, winldd 1007 (none has a win64 revisionOverride).
# * Destinations: lib/server/registry/index.js readDescriptors, the browser
#   name with "-" as "_", then "-<revision>", under the ".local-browsers"
#   directory PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH=0 selects (registryDirectory).
# * URLs: DOWNLOAD_PATHS[name]["win64"] (hostPlatform is "win64" on every
#   Windows host) on PLAYWRIGHT_CDN_MIRRORS[0]. A closure entry names one URL;
#   the second mirror, playwright.download.prss.microsoft.com, served the same
#   bytes for all four.
# * Layout: each archive's members already sit where EXECUTABLE_PATHS[name].win
#   expects them below the destination (chrome-win/chrome.exe,
#   chrome-win/headless_shell.exe, ffmpeg-win64.exe, PrintDeps.exe), so no
#   entry strips a component. Every member path was listed and none is
#   absolute or contains "..".
# * sha256: computed 2026-11-12 over each archive downloaded from both
#   mirrors (sizes 156153766, 95373298, 1411741 and 128684 bytes).
